# kettle.sy

You: Kettle!
Kettle: Yeah?
You: Heat Sensor!
Heat Sensor: Here.
You: Switch!
Switch: Ready.
You: Kettle, when I am filled, tell Heat Sensor.
Kettle: Okay, when you fill me, I will tell Heat Sensor.
You: Heat Sensor, when Kettle tells you, check the water.
Heat Sensor: Okay, I will check the water.
You: Heat Sensor, when you are above 100, tell Switch.
Heat Sensor: Okay, when I am above 100, I will tell Switch.
You: Switch, when Heat Sensor tells you, change my state to off.
Switch: Okay, when Heat Sensor tells me, I will change my state to off.
You: Kettle, when Switch changes its state, tell me.
Kettle: Okay, when Switch changes, I will tell you.
You: System, orchestrate my symphony.
System: Ok. I will orchestrate it.